{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c7ac910b-a11d-5123-877d-77ef606ec789", "source_ordinal": 1059, "reading_ordinal": 2998, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "弄潮", "published_at": "2024-12-31T17:31:18.251000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/03bde97ac75911efa97752540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "父母最容易犯的错误之一，就是不自觉地认为自己应该成为子女的唯一或者至少是至高的信息来源。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所谓唯一信息来源，是指其他信息来源都应该受到自己管理、审核，在自己没批准、没审查过的前提下，子女不应该接触其他的信息来源，接触到了也不应该相信，尤其是不能拿来作为和父母顶撞的依据。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果有，父母就会有一种“子女和外界敌人里应外合出卖家里的主权”的丧失感，容易经由这个丧失感产生敌对情绪，进而在这个情绪的驱使下惩罚“内奸”——也就是懵懂无知的子女。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而子女则往往会因此产生本能的报复心，这个报复心最显然、最迅捷的实现方式，就是故意紧抱明显让父母焦虑恐惧的东西——也就是你恰恰想要从ta的世界里根除的东西。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "否则这个问题也不存在了。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个想法要做如下修正：", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "1）父母的确有干预子女接触的信息的权利，但是这个权利在客观上是有上限的，对这个上限要抱有一种积极的态度，而不是消极的态度。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "啥意思呢？就是你觉得该挡的你尽量挡，但尽量挡了还是没挡下来的，不要将其认定为一种敌意的、恶意的厄运，而要认定为包含着你所难以理解的善意的天意。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "对你的子女真正拥有完全的教育主权的，其实一直是客观世界本身，父母只是客观世界给子女的安排的一部分，父母是不应该“一手遮天”的。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "子女命定该受的教育天然地就由父母主动给予的教育和父母无法阻拦的教育两个部分组成，这两个部分加起来才成为子女完整命运的基础。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你不能、也不可能独占子女命运的全部决定因素，甚至哪怕你动用不该动用的手段多占据了一部分——例如用不合自然法的手段囚禁子女、恫吓甚至伤害外人——你只会给自己和子女在原有的命运上带来额外的伤害和作恶后对命运报复的恐惧。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "说到底，你仍然在相信你所控制不了的一定是恶意的、坏的，你在认定世界是你无孔不入、无所不用其极的敌人。仅仅这一个思想底色，你自己就不可能过得幸福，也无法成为别人幸福的来源，注定最终会被所有人逃离。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以，于公于私、于人于己，你都要放下那个“我拦不住的都是坏的”的执念——你拦不住的，其实是好的，只是你不知道好在哪里而已。", "char_start": 789, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "有人又要反过来想——那既然我拦不住的是好的，我是不是不该做任何阻拦了？", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 886}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "当然不是，只要你动念要拦、而且动用自然法权限范围内能拦得住的，那就是天意也不愿意你子女沾染的东西，否则天意又何必把你们安排在这个位置上呢？只有在经过这一道过滤之后你仍然拦不住的，才成其为“无法理解的好意”的一部分。", "char_start": 887, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你可以这么理解，世界输入的东西像石油，你是一座蒸馏塔，你将分离出汽油、天然气等等轻质油，并把你所处理不了的东西排除掉，但被你排除掉的这部分里面并不全是废物，其实还可以提炼出柴油、重油和沥青。连这部分都排除掉，才是真正的无益有害的残渣。", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果你完全放弃掉自己的职责，那么由于进入下一流程的东西要经过的是另一个加工工艺，本来该由你提前分离出来的那些成分其实是不适合用这个工艺加工的，就会被平白消耗掉一部分，甚至是大部分，就会形成总收益的损失。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1214}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以你要尽职尽责，在尽职尽责的基础上，对经过你这个流程仍然未能处理的残留物不要简单的抱着仇视的态度，而要抱着“这里面有我无法直接替ta们提取的好东西”的态度去看待。", "char_start": 1215, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "2）对这部分东西，要保持好奇、探讨的态度。", "char_start": 1299, "char_end": 1320}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "某种意义上讲，这部分的东西是子女自己缺少直观体验，而父母也很难安排有充分说服力的实践测试的东西。有的是父母根据自己的人生认为绝不能接受的东西，有的是父母自己也不明白所以感到恐惧的东西。", "char_start": 1321, "char_end": 1413}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "对这些东西，切忌跳过了解、好奇的阶段直接否定。", "char_start": 1414, "char_end": 1437}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "哪怕只是走个过场，你也要先在子女面前老老实实地经过一个“这具体是什么，怎么区分它和其他东西，有什么规则，有什么成功案例，有何失败案例，有什么关键条件……”的询问、了解过程。", "char_start": 1438, "char_end": 1524}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这个过程非常重要，因为这本身就是子女渴望的尊重。", "char_start": 1525, "char_end": 1549}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "子女并不期待你必须接受这些东西，甚至可以接受你最终不接受这些东西，但ta们不能接受你对ta们觉得很好的东西连一个公平的了解的机会都不给就直接予以否定。", "char_start": 1550, "char_end": 1625}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这就像我很喜欢吃一道菜，竭力向你推荐，而且我明确地知道你没吃过，我完全可以接受你尝一口后不接受，甚至只是端上来看看、闻闻气味就不接受，我也可以接受你在拒绝品尝和亲眼观察之前暂时对这个东西的好坏暂时不表态，但如果你是在没有做我认为是基本的了解之前就激烈地、断然地否定它，那么在我心里，你的可信度就要打很大的折扣。", "char_start": 1626, "char_end": 1781}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为我目睹了你的傲慢，而我凭直觉就能看到你这个态度意味着我对你以后所有的否定式判定不能再寄予过多的预先信任。", "char_start": 1782, "char_end": 1836}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这种反应只是人之常情，甚至你换到子女的角度看这就是理所当然的，但是换到你的角度看，就是非常直观的“影响力大减”。", "char_start": 1837, "char_end": 1893}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "所以，哪怕只是“履行必要手续”，你也要严格地、积极地去安排这个“好奇、观察、了解”的手续，而绝不能在本能焦虑和反感的驱使下条件反射式地跳过这个过程。", "char_start": 1894, "char_end": 1968}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "否则，不论你之后的辩论会不会赢，仅仅“跳过”这个行为本身就足以大幅地破坏你的影响力，你已经遭受了最严重的损失。", "char_start": 1969, "char_end": 2024}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而如果这个好奇、了解的步骤你做好、做足，则恰恰相反，无论你之后的讨论是什么结果，你已经避免了子女对你判断力的根本怀疑这个最坏的结果，就算后面有损失也是战术性的。", "char_start": 2025, "char_end": 2105}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "很多父母之所以没有机会去挽回子女的极端行为，根本原因就在于在一次次的条件反射式的跳过中耗尽了子女对父母的判断力的信任。", "char_start": 2106, "char_end": 2165}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这个信任的丧失不是因为你一次次的判ta有错，而是因为判ta有错的程序存在瑕疵。尽管子女常常表达为对你的判决的积怨，但实际上这个积怨的根源不是其结果，而是其过程。", "char_start": 2166, "char_end": 2246}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "3）要清醒地意识到——有效的怀疑比坚决反对和严厉批判更好。", "char_start": 2248, "char_end": 2277}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "对这部分内容，其实子女只要拿出来，在心态上就没有接受直接反对的余地。因为ta拿出来的时候已经同时抵押了自己的人格尊严、自己对自己的认可，如果遭遇直接否定，要么会激烈反抗，要么干脆还要“以身相殉”。", "char_start": 2278, "char_end": 2376}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "所以，仅仅是寻求“坚决否定”这个目标就是错误的，只是你自己焦虑发作的冲动结果。", "char_start": 2377, "char_end": 2416}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你要学会以“提出有效的怀疑”为足够满意的目标。", "char_start": 2417, "char_end": 2440}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "有效的怀疑会自然成为一时冲动的子女的长期关注点，ta们自然会对这些ta们解决不了的疑点、脆弱点、矛盾点长期在意和盘桓。你不必担心ta们看上去大大咧咧没心没肺自似乎无其事，其实只要这个怀疑是有效的、公平的，ta们自己会在意，而且随着合理怀疑持续得不到解决的时间越长，教育的种子会自己破土而出，最终推翻站不住脚的妄念和幻想。", "char_start": 2441, "char_end": 2601}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "前提是怀疑必须有效，只有有效的怀疑才会是活的种子，才能稍有滋润就会茁壮发育，才有这种去芜存真的效应。", "char_start": 2602, "char_end": 2652}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "有效怀疑，是指即使集合你与对方双方的智力资源都解决不了的方案疑点——例如“如果按这么办，那么遇到xx情况的时候要如何防止出现xx结果？”", "char_start": 2653, "char_end": 2721}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "例如“如果这一点按这样解释，那么那个与之对立的原则要如何理解？”", "char_start": 2722, "char_end": 2754}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "例如“如果存在这样的客观规律，那么如何解释看上去与之矛盾的那个现象的存在？”", "char_start": 2755, "char_end": 2793}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "但你要注意——这不是你明知结果如何而故意改成问句形式来制造“合理怀疑”的姿态，而是你知道一些当前理论解释不了的矛盾点、操作问题，但抱着“也许ta可以提出我没想到的角度和办法”的心态，给对方一个公平的机会去思考是否存在这种角度和办法。", "char_start": 2794, "char_end": 2910}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你自己是没想到，不然你也不会是你现在的这个观点立场，但此时你不能因为你没想到过就断言对方一定解释不了、一定也无法可想，因为这是在无声地断言“你不可能想到我没想到过的办法”。", "char_start": 2911, "char_end": 2997}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "抱着这个态度，你就不可能造成合理的怀疑，即使采用“提出合理怀疑”的姿态，实际造成的也只是嘲弄、讽刺这样的负面后果。", "char_start": 2998, "char_end": 3055}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "同样的，你自己知道一些ta不知道的信息，你装作不知道去提出怀疑，这也一样有违“集合你与对方双方的智力资源都解决不了”的原则，这样的怀疑一样是死种子，不但无益，反而有害。", "char_start": 3056, "char_end": 3140}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "如果你诚恳的站在“不妨先尽力为这个观点辩护”的立场，充分的分享了你的智力资源，结果子女发现在这个前提下，这些时髦的、酷炫的做法其实埋藏着ta会顾虑的隐忧，而你也没有抱着“你一定想不到办法”的态度去刺激ta基于“自尊心”去坚持这些方案的本能，那么ta可能当场不会如你所愿立刻表示放弃这个说法，但这个说法的生命力已经受到了你能给的最大的挑战了。", "char_start": 3141, "char_end": 3311}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "但是到这里为止，你要记住——这东西如果这样还能活下去，那么这东西约等于“身负天命”，就是你子女该有的命运的一部分。", "char_start": 3312, "char_end": 3369}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "也许的确会让那ta们走一段你极其不愿看到的弯路、遭受一些你难以忍受的损失，但是你要坚定地相信这些弯路和损失最终会呈现你会感激的价值——幸好现在就以这样的形式发作了，不然再晚点、再换一个形式，后果可能更坏。幸亏子女有过这样的经历和经验，事后看ta的辉煌成就其实和这些经历所形成的经验教训是分不开的。", "char_start": 3370, "char_end": 3518}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "那是上天给予的教育，你不能、也不该强行阻拦。", "char_start": 3519, "char_end": 3541}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "相信拦不住的、合理的怀疑也不能遏止的必有其长远的价值。", "char_start": 3542, "char_end": 3569}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "与其在子女身上继续施压，反不如自己平时多结善缘、广行好事，给自己足够多、足够深的理由相信上天有理由给你足够的宽容。", "char_start": 3570, "char_end": 3627}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "上面这些都尽力做好，你就不必恐惧这些外部世界给你的挑战了。", "char_start": 3628, "char_end": 3657}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 55}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：深耕教育的朋友，孩子拿网络上的“负面潮话”与你诡辩，该如何应对引导？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052"], "summary": "围绕“弄潮”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“父母最容易犯的错误之一，就是不自觉地认为自己应该成为子女的唯一或者至少是至高的信息来源。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "父母最容易犯的错误之一，就是不自觉地认为自己应该成为子女的唯一或者至少是至高的信息来源。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "73dd1a87-db1b-5265-bd80-95c209970cc6", "source_ordinal": 1058, "reading_ordinal": 2999, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "人的目的", "published_at": "2025-01-01T04:48:50.767000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/57065901/answer/68784662527"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "活着是为了让别人活得更好，并借着活得更好的人们的帮助，实现自己的价值，享受人生的挑战，战胜自己的匮乏和死亡。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实就这么朴素。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "爱是世界上最快乐却又回报最丰厚的事，既是人的目的，又是人的手段，也是人的价值。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实这就是这么多年这几百万字、几千个答案要不断剖析、展示、见证给你们看的东西。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个就是答案，只不过要相信“这就是答案”需要无数次的亲身尝试后的心服口服。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这有点像调试一个程序，新手们不是这里搞错数据类型，就是那里不小心用错指针，又或者这里搞错一个大小写、那里打掉一个括号。或者更常见的——开发环境配置有问题。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "总而言之，每次试运行都有千奇百怪的报错。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果自己没有亲眼看到身边有人跑通过、如果没有地方提问交流，很容易就放弃了，于是“这不适合我”“不是这块料”“这根本行不通”就会成为答案。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而一旦因此放弃了这个方向，就无法体会到手握“编程能力”意味着什么样的神力——如果你是真的明白，真的掌握，其实仅凭这一条，你就不再恐惧匮乏、也不再忧虑孤独了。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为这种魔法般的力量本身就可以回答绝大多数的困惑和问题。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那些问题本身就是因为假定“爱已经绝不可选”，却又无论如何找不到全生命周期内都能替代爱的备选方案才产生的。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你可以找到在某些时段、某些方面、某些情况下暂时地、片面地替代爱的手段，而且看上去似乎上手简单、见效快，但可惜人生太长，而人生是无限连续的，很快这些局部有效的方法就会脱离有效的情境、时段和需求，你会发现要想像关灯换挡一样“弃武从文”，这个切换操作所带来的成本、风险往往会将其之前为你带来的好处吞噬一空，还要你付出更多代价。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "换了又换，你最后会发现，其实这不是“最优选择”，而是唯一选择。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "希望将来会有越来越多把这程序跑通了、并在一轮轮的调试中看见了这背后的道、其信念已经被不断的成功锻打成钢的人们，能花更多的时间帮助还没找到那个打漏的括号、还看不懂错误提示、还找不到那个关键的环境参数的新手们把ta们的尝试变得更容易、更成功。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 823}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "跑通了，搞懂了，你会明白的——这毫无疑问就是人活着的意义。", "char_start": 824, "char_end": 853}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：谁能告诉我活着是为了什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“人的目的”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“活着是为了让别人活得更好，并借着活得更好的人们的帮助，实现自己的价值，享受人生的挑战，战胜自己的匮乏和死亡。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "活着是为了让别人活得更好，并借着活得更好的人们的帮助，实现自己的价值，享受人生的挑战，战胜自己的匮乏和死亡。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cf2d90b5-e419-5409-bc8e-4105f792c2a9", "source_ordinal": 1057, "reading_ordinal": 3000, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "四十不惑", "published_at": "2025-01-01T07:21:43.108000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f88e21b2c7cd11ef9ec952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一些做自己的产品去了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实“设计师”在根本上讲是发现问题和解决问题的人。尤其是认知问题、表达问题、感受问题。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "市场上存在这类问题的产品其实不少，其实生产工艺并没有很高的门槛，因为产业链的成熟，质量也有相当保障，加上现在电商平台的完善发达，物流体系的方便快捷，只要抓住了要害，设计师是很容易为老产品注入新意义、新形式、新体验来短平快地获取自己的市场空间的。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "小的文创用品就不说了，不少设计师都会进一步地精研特殊工艺，配合自己的自媒体运营，为自己耕耘一个稳固的客户群，例如做水泥定制珠宝的、做定制茶具、家具的，做纹章戒指的、做艺术刀剑的。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "设计师是很适合学一门手艺的，其实很多传统手艺并没有传说的那么神奇艰难，对充分掌握现代知识框架的聪明人，配上明确自觉的目的性，大部分都构不成无法跨越的困难。这些技艺配合上现代商业的经验和技术能力，可以做出很多令人惊叹的小东西来。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实中国的市场是真的很大，你们多去看看现代艺术展、文创展这些就知道了，真是群星璀璨、英雄辈出，真不必忧虑有本事会没饭吃——值得忧虑的只有没本事。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "真不必忧虑有本事会没饭吃——值得忧虑的只有没本事。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而本事其实也不必真的那么忧虑——哪怕你真的错过了整个基础教育，例如初二开始颓废迷茫，休学丧志一路蹉跎到二十几岁甚至三十几岁，只要你真正地醒悟了、悔改了、知道踏踏实实走正道的重要性、懂得为服务他人而努力了，真的没有什么来不及的。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "哪怕三十岁时你只会玩手机打游戏、什么别的也不会，从这时沉下心来安静地、谦卑地、正心诚意地开始学习，一样足以安身立命。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实很少有人意识到，学习本身是需要一颗久经磨洗的心的。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实世界上最好的学生是五六十岁的老人们。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在久历沧桑的时候，ta们终于可以放下杂念妄心，看山是山，看云是云，日拱一卒，勇猛精进。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不要因为你年纪小，常被红尘遮眼、爱恨分心导致岁月蹉跎而感到沮丧——那是你必须要经过的一个过程，一个陈化、浸润的过程。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的心要快点老起来，要老到不惑、老到知天命，你才真的知道什么是好的、什么是坏的，才能稳稳地拿着好的，拒绝坏的，在那之前，其实你们学富五车也罢、目不识丁也罢，都如梦似戏，只是你真正天命的前奏而已，跑快三步的不必得意，落后一里的也不必沮丧。", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "时候到了，正戏才会开始。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 939}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "某种意义上讲，到了这一步，你开始直接面对市场、直接面对用户了，你才真的开始了属于你的正戏。", "char_start": 940, "char_end": 985}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那之前的，只是热身、学前教育而已。", "char_start": 986, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个正戏，其实的确是35-40来岁才开锣呢。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "二十几岁，一无所有、一无是处、一败涂地，其实是对的，是好的，是应该的，其实不比二十几岁春风得意、扬鞭奋蹄、自认前程似锦差。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1088}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为经由无可抵赖的惨败而习得的谦卑是无价之宝，胜过一切的知识和技能。", "char_start": 1089, "char_end": 1123}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "真正的危险，不是你这时候有多失败、有多贫穷，而是在这关头上，你还紧抱着自己的傲慢不放，一是仍然不愿静思己过，二是傲慢地认定将来再也没有希望了。", "char_start": 1124, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "其实这时你的失败是要来祝福你的，真正要杀死你的，是在百败之余自己仍然当成最后的宝贝、死抱着不放手的、伪装成“自尊”的傲慢。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1257}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "现在刺激你惶恐不安地询问这个问题的，其实正是这个你舍不得放手的傲慢。", "char_start": 1258, "char_end": 1292}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这东西不是你的天使、也不是你“最后剩下的唯一一点尊严”，而是你的仇敌，你的魔鬼。", "char_start": 1293, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "时候到了，你能看明白，你就会走上坡路。", "char_start": 1334, "char_end": 1353}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "真正踏实的上坡路。", "char_start": 1354, "char_end": 1363}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这种上坡路走上几步，你就会大彻大悟——前半生错得有多厉害、多彻底，自己醒悟得有多晚。", "char_start": 1364, "char_end": 1406}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而一旦醒悟，你就再也不会担心这些了。", "char_start": 1407, "char_end": 1425}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "后面全是上坡，吃力只是上坡路最健康的感觉，走就是了。", "char_start": 1426, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "一切都来得及，不必担心。", "char_start": 1453, "char_end": 1465}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：三四十岁的老设计师都干什么去了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“四十不惑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一些做自己的产品去了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一些做自己的产品去了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c259d5dd-43ac-5a97-b5a5-a7156a52ccff", "source_ordinal": 1056, "reading_ordinal": 3001, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "言不由衷", "published_at": "2025-01-02T05:10:57.517000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/c8b444bec88411ef98285254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "以后要记住，同志、朋友、亲人、恋人、配偶……只要你觉得以后想要把关系处好、想一直留在你生命中的人，都绝不能跟ta们讲反话、表反态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一是一、二是二，同意就是同意、反对就是反对，绝不能制造一个“我说的其实是反话，你这都看不出来吗”的例子。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你如果说了反话，则反话所造成的一切后果都要由你承担，对方不但不必为“这都听不出来”道歉，反而是你要为“竟然对朋友、亲人、同志说反话”道歉。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你不道歉，即刻被除名，没有第二种处理。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你自己误导人，做完全相反的表态，然后去把“超强纠错”的责任放在对方头上、如果这让你罪名安稳了，以后对方把你的每句话反着理解，要怪谁？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你说句同意，结果既可能是同意、也可能是不同意，得要自己猜，猜错了责任该猜的人承担，那么询问你的意见有何意义？", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这已经决定了你只能承担一种无需考虑你任何意见的关系，这类关系有哪些？——奴隶主对奴隶就不需要考虑奴隶的意见、征服者对战俘就不用考虑战俘的意见、偶像对崇拜者就不用考虑崇拜者的意见。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而这些关系无疑和同志、朋友、亲人关系是不相容的。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "朋友必须要考虑对方的意愿、亲人必须要考虑对方的意愿。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你这么干一下，立这么一种会令你的意愿实质无效化的法，就是自己取消了自己成为同志、朋友、亲人的资格。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为按照你这个立法，你将无须再为你的任何意愿承担任何责任，而对方则势必要无休止地受到自己根本无法避免的惩罚。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这根本不可行。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以你这种行为只要露出一点最轻微的迹象，懂得爱必须要什么资格条件的人就会立刻先取消你的资格。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你只能先跟无爱、不懂爱的人互相折磨几年再说了。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这话只要我这么说了，你就用字面意思理解，如果和字面意思不符，责任我自己承担。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我绝不会对我的朋友说反话，哪怕是开玩笑也不会，这是一种基本原则问题，“可以比较开心”这种微不足道的理由根本不是亵渎这个原则的合理借口。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "通过有效的关系带给对方的欢乐已经足足够用了，反而那些自知于人无益的人才会如此看重所谓“嬉笑轻松”的“友谊”。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你将来年纪越大，就会越痛恨那些“嬉笑轻松”但却毫无效能、毫无信用的人物。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "娱乐价值有的是地方可以获得，你不缺这点“免费”的娱乐——免费的东西最贵。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 892}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "更何况，风趣、幽默并不需要说反话这种有毒的技巧。", "char_start": 893, "char_end": 917}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那是无能之辈才死抱着不放手的法宝。", "char_start": 918, "char_end": 935}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我去买排骨，男朋友把排骨煮了问我吃不吃，我客气一下说不吃，但是他真的一点也没给我留，是我的问题吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“言不由衷”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“以后要记住，同志、朋友、亲人、恋人、配偶……只要你觉得以后想要把关系处好、想一直留在你生命中的人，都绝不能跟ta们讲反话、表反态。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "以后要记住，同志、朋友、亲人、恋人、配偶……只要你觉得以后想要把关系处好、想一直留在你生命中的人，都绝不能跟ta们讲反话、表反态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8ed697c1-c8dc-545a-a480-88c6f425be79", "source_ordinal": 1055, "reading_ordinal": 3002, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "历史的手续费", "published_at": "2025-01-02T08:55:53.773000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/3b08bbe8c8a411efb81752540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一个规律要注意——人对“公平”“合理”的认知并不是建立在某种朴素的数学对称性基础上的，而是建立在ta自己的预期基础上的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "准确地说，ta有一个自我分类定位，凡是ta认为与自己定位相同的人普遍享有的待遇，ta没得到，ta就会产生不公平感。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "比如尽管没有任何明确规定，但历来班上前三名可以的三好学生，ta是前三名却没得到，ta就会觉得不公平。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "例如班上别的同学都曾经出国度假，ta没有，ta就会觉得不公平。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个才是“执着”“愤懑”的真正原理。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "换句话来说，人们主张“公平”“应该”，更多地是基于传统、惯例，而不是很多年轻人不假思索地认为的“社会的基本法则”。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这本来应该是个常识，因为时时处处都是如此，一向都是如此，但年轻人往往会觉得很惊讶。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这里固然有年轻人是通过学校教育对社会形成预期的原因——学校没法花那么多时间讲社会百态，更何况各个地区、各个时期的先例、惯例也不尽相同，连教材也很难写。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但还有另一重隐秘的原因——讲传统、讲惯例，年轻人天然地被动，所以年轻人也有一点揣着明白装糊涂、要把战斗保持在自己的主场的意思。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样是不行的，主要是这样会导致你有很多“惊讶的意外”。总是发现现实与自己的意料之间有巨大的差异——甚至是背道而驰——这是一个有强烈致郁效应的祸源。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "记住，人们不是按理想法则来看待“公平”和“应该”的，你要先了解这人目前所处的传统惯例是什么样，根据这个来估计对方的反应。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不错，很可能你期待的那个方案更符合理想的法则、符合历史潮流，但是请注意——你还需要付出历史的代价，才能得到历史给你的应许。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "并不是历史应许给你了，你就可以直接拿着这个许诺去要求旧的一切自付搬家费自己打包走人，你只需要拎包入住，而是你拿着历史的应许，还要替对方支付搬家费，然后你才能入住。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“应该”的确是应该，但应该也得支付代价。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不要觉得这有什么不公平，历史上所有更新更好的理念的实现，都不是更新更好的理念一提出，旧人旧事就恍然大悟主动下台把舞台让出来的——哪怕ta们自己都觉得自己是要被淘汰的一方，ta们也不会自己离开。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以凭什么到你这里，到你这件事上这个规律就理应失效？", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "心态放平，去思考如何让自己的理念以最小的代价实现，这本来就是应有的程序，没有什么不公平的。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 931}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么男朋友对第一个孩子的冠姓权非常在意？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“历史的手续费”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一个规律要注意——人对“公平”“合理”的认知并不是建立在某种朴素的数学对称性基础上的，而是建立在ta自己的预期基础上的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一个规律要注意——人对“公平”“合理”的认知并不是建立在某种朴素的数学对称性基础上的，而是建立在ta自己的预期基础上的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5018ceee-ae4a-538c-b7b5-cbd229587dca", "source_ordinal": 1054, "reading_ordinal": 3003, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "治未病", "published_at": "2025-01-03T08:12:54.609000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/34027f78c96711ef9f9152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "怎么说呢，医生对你是不是真的想好起来是有直觉的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "ta们不喜欢那些非常想要被确诊，最好严重一点，而且最好久治不愈、药石罔效的病人。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那些内心暗暗地想要病着，不想要好起来的病人。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不是说年轻患者都是这样，但年轻患者里想要把医生变成“父母劝退者”“休学批准员”“假条印刷机”“社交特权专员”的人实在太多。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "医生会觉得自己在造孽。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "明明是在被利用，但是要抗拒被利用，自己要冒很大的风险、承担巨大的心理压力——坚持专业立场拒绝给出有病诊断，小孩回去用zs来证明“你看错了”是完全干得出来的。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而自己不担这个风险，就很难抗拒被胁迫成为那些工具，自己良心难安。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "说实在的，要不是偶尔会遇上一些真的想好起来的病人，偶尔有一些真的值得安慰的病例，这个工作是很难做长久的。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真的想好起来的病人，需要人拉一把的同时自己在用力，只需要最小的帮助就能帮ta站起来。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不想好起来的病人，让你拉就是为了向别人证明自己真的起不来，不是自己的错。要是一就诊就好转了，那自己渴望了那么久的可以放松 、可以不被批评、不被管理的福利岂不是立刻要消失？", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只有没有好才能保住这个福利，所以这些“病人”不但自己不配合用力，还会用各种手段悄悄地破坏帮助的效果。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "医生的职业生命也是有限的，人家想要真正地积点福，不要被这样利用作孽，这很难理解吗？", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你要说自己有什么问题，可以，但真正的问题是——你想要好起来吗？", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你真的想痊愈吗？", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "很多人的病，并不是病在有病上，而是病在“不想痊愈”上。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个病，医生治不了。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 629}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有的精神科医生不喜欢搭理年轻抑郁患者？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“治未病”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“怎么说呢，医生对你是不是真的想好起来是有直觉的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "怎么说呢，医生对你是不是真的想好起来是有直觉的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2de0cb11-2db0-5352-8fe2-610d7cdb5cbc", "source_ordinal": 1053, "reading_ordinal": 3004, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "欣赏与自我欣赏", "published_at": "2025-01-03T11:34:32.610000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/21d57fbec98311efa91852540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这看上去是一个如何与别人相处的问题，但实际上是一个如何与自己相处的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为它的关键在于你自己欣不欣赏你自己。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你如果自己不欣赏你自己或者自己欣赏的点和对方的原因对不上，那么别人的欣赏你就会觉得紧张、忐忑，生怕啥时候对方的美好印象破灭。自己会猝不及防地受到某种“欺骗”的指控，甚至可能会因此受到莫名的惩罚。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而问题更大的点在于——大多数人又不敢欣赏自己。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）人们长期听说一种“如果得意起来就会停止进步”的可怕绝症，约等于“乱伸懒腰就会停止发育”。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）人们自己体会过如果有一个人体现出自己对自己非常欣赏、满意、快乐，自己心底里的那种嫉妒催生出的恶毒恨意，也见识过这种恶意刺激出的种种“欲加之罪”和“风必摧之”。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以人很怕自己对自己欣赏起来，一不小心就走漏风声，不小心露了白，要成为众矢之的。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，既然自我欣赏选项被完全关闭了，当有外人欣赏自己的时候，自己是万万不敢附和、不敢自居甘受的。因为这种附和本身不就是一种自我暴露吗？万一要传了出去岂不是死无葬身之地？", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是这样就拧住了——要是你胆敢认为自己还有点东西、还是个人物、还有点价值，你就该死。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而你要是觉得自己不是个东西，不是个人物，没有任何价值，你又想死。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有人欣赏你，你都不敢接，你想死，要是你敢接，你该死。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一般人倒也罢了，问题是谈恋爱咋办？专门跟不欣赏自己的谈？", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "想想更想死了。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "为什么难，难在哪，这里基本都概括了吧？", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "怎么破解这种逻辑死局？", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "要害完全不在题面里，功夫全在诗外——那就是你一定要有功德在外。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 639}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你有一些事，人人提起来都感谢你，你就可以自我欣赏了。", "char_start": 640, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "何止可以自我欣赏，人们还生怕你不够自我欣赏会放弃人生——你的存在对我们大有好处，要是你啥时候了无生趣买块豆腐一头撞死了，第一我们没有福利了，第二我们还要被“连让好人想活下去都做不到”的念头折磨——这还不是羞耻心的事，而是既然我们无能到这种程度，我们怎么能指望日子越过越好呢？", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以一旦你是一个很好的人，一个发展起来大家的生活都会变好的人，那拜托你赶紧自我欣赏起来，你要是自我欣赏不起来，我们大家一起上，挨个给你欣赏一遍，说服你自我欣赏。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你终于学会自我欣赏了，我们只会赶紧点赞，赶紧给你见证，生怕你明天又反悔。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果是这样，你根本不会问“如何和欣赏自己的人相处”这种问题。", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "看出问题来没有？", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "自我欣赏、被人欣赏，其实都是行善积德的附带奖励。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 987}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而且不是那种有争议的行善积德，而是那种治病救人、扶危济困、没有争议、你自己都不能否认的行善积德。", "char_start": 988, "char_end": 1036}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这方面越强，这个问题自然越弱乃至自我消散。", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这方面越弱，这个问题就会发展到不可解。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "说直白点—— 一个满脑子只有自己、找人说话都是为了自己爽的自了汉、寄生虫，要是还自我欣赏得团团转，是人都容不得。", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1135}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "人容不得，就会自动地用无数花样百出的惩罚、攻击甚至干脆是造谣污蔑教会你“绝不能自我欣赏”，后面接着的全是死局。", "char_start": 1136, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你把这个问题搞好，哪怕每次自我欣赏得原地转圈圈，信不信一般评价都是“萌”。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1229}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0435"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么和欣赏自己的人相处?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“欣赏与自我欣赏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这看上去是一个如何与别人相处的问题，但实际上是一个如何与自己相处的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这看上去是一个如何与别人相处的问题，但实际上是一个如何与自己相处的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
